        }
      },
      "comment": "Menu item: search the current session's commands and output"
    },
    "Zonder shell-integratie raadt sssh waar een opdracht begint en eindigt aan de hand van de regel die je shell teruggeeft. Dat werkt, maar de afsluitcode blijft onbekend en de grens klopt niet altijd.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Without shell integration, sssh works out where a command starts and ends from the line your shell echoes back. That works, but the exit status stays unknown and the boundary is not always right."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Explains what the fallback segmentation can and cannot do"
    },
    "geen": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "none"
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Placeholder when no credential was offered"
    },
    "sssh kan sleutels van het type %@ nog niet gebruiken. Zet de sleutel om met ssh-keygen.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "sssh cannot use %@ keys yet. Convert the key with ssh-keygen."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "The key file is a type the app cannot use yet; suggests converting it"
    },
    "sssh kent deze server nog niet. Controleer de vingerafdruk voordat u verbindt.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "sssh does not know this server yet. Check the fingerprint before connecting."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Asks the user to verify the fingerprint on a first connection"
    },
    "sssh ondersteunt ssh-agent nog niet.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "sssh does not support ssh-agent yet."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Agent forwarding is not implemented"
    },
    "sssh past zelf niets aan op de server. Plak het er zelf in, zodat je ziet wat er verandert.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "sssh changes nothing on the server itself. Paste it in yourself, so you can see what changes."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "States that sssh never edits the remote configuration itself"
    },
